# Arc Lightning divides 3 damage: 2 to Grizzly Bears, 1 to the ai player.
# CR 601.2d: the division is announced right after the targets, each target
# getting at least one; DamageDealEffect.java:248 deals each target its own
# share, NumDmg$ unread. The Bears die (CR 704.5g), the ai goes to 19.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 R
tapformana human 3 R
tapformana human 4 R
queue targets 5,ai
queue divide 2,1
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
castspell human 1
resolvestack
